  "id": "1aa0a4f353b2a26a75b5db5181646d1d",
  "name": {
   "zh": "全景分割 · VidEoMT",
   "en": "Panoptic Segmentation · VidEoMT"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "VidEoMT 是只有编码器的轻量在线视频分割模型，建在普通的 Vision Transformer 上，空间和时间的推理都在编码器里完成，不依赖专门的目标跟随模块。这张卡不写提示词，把每个像素分到 VIPSeg 124 类，交付多层 EXR：第一层是原画面，其余是 Cryptomatte。",
   "en": "VidEoMT is a lightweight encoder-only online video segmentation model built on a plain Vision Transformer, doing spatial and temporal reasoning inside the encoder without a dedicated tracking module. This card needs no prompt and assigns every pixel to one of 124 VIPSeg classes, delivering a multi-layer EXR: the first layer is the original image, the rest are Cryptomatte."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-13T12:00:00",
  "deliverable": "mask",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
